# Byproduct of scripts/make-loading-gif.cjs — a mid-loop still for eyeballing the
# install graphic. Only the .gif it sits next to is shipped.
assets/_loading-preview.png

# OS-generated files
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Entra federation values (#63): per-organization, non-secret but org-identifying.
# Baked into the main bundle at build time by vite.main.config.ts. Deliberately never
# committed: this repo is PUBLIC, and a repo naming a tenant and an Anthropic org is
# free reconnaissance that would live in git history forever. Copy
# src/main/entra/federation.example.json and fill it in.
src/main/entra/federation.local.json
